      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了不辜负粉丝们的期待，\n迎战『宝冢纪念』，\n我们继续着每天刻苦训练的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa55e90ad9f48bc5e6c0ec5452e38ca390d57bb0ac241d7c07a86a497910c4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
